# THEHIVE Worker (System B, worker/src/index.js) — local dev secrets template.
#
# This is the file that actually matters for the LIVE, production system
# (thehive.sovereignhive.workers.dev). Copy it to `.dev.vars` (gitignored) for
# local `npx wrangler dev` — Cloudflare's own convention, not a generic .env.
#
# PRODUCTION secrets are NEVER set from a file at all — Cloudflare Workers in
# production only read secrets bound via `npx wrangler secret put <NAME>`,
# logged into the hive's Cloudflare account. That is the ONLY way any of the
# variables below actually take effect on the live Worker. See
# FLIP_THE_SWITCHES.md section 3 for the exact commands.
#
# CONFIRMED LIVE STATUS (2026-07-21, via GET /v11/llm/status through the
# edge-health-probe GitHub Actions workflow — this repo can't curl
# *.workers.dev directly, egress-blocked):
#   {"active_provider":"workers-ai","providers":["workers-ai"],
#    "roster":[{"id":"claude","bound":false},{"id":"groq","bound":false},
#              {"id":"mistral","bound":false}]}
# GET /v11/debug/env also confirms "secrets_present":[] — zero Worker
# secrets are currently bound, of any kind. The Worker is running entirely on
# the free Workers AI fallback (@cf/meta/llama-3.2-1b-instruct). If you
# recently added a key somewhere, it has not reached the live Worker — most
# likely it went into a local .env file (which Workers never read) instead of
# `wrangler secret put`. Re-run the three commands below to actually bind them.

# Claude — reasoning tier (top of the waterfall)
# ACTIVATE: npx wrangler secret put ANTHROPIC_API_KEY
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Groq — speed tier
# ACTIVATE: npx wrangler secret put GROQ_API_KEY
GROQ_API_KEY=

# Mistral — local-intelligence tier
# ACTIVATE: npx wrangler secret put MISTRAL_API_KEY
MISTRAL_API_KEY=

# Write-endpoint anti-spam gate. Unset = fail-open (dev-permissive, current
# live state). Set = every write endpoint requires a valid visitor token.
# ACTIVATE: npx wrangler secret put WORKER_ADMIN_KEY
WORKER_ADMIN_KEY=

# Proposals-channel decide-gate. Unset = fail-closed (nobody, including the
# founder, can approve/reject — by design). Set = the Proposals panel's
# Approve/Reject buttons work once you paste the same value into the panel.
# ACTIVATE: npx wrangler secret put FOUNDER_KEY
FOUNDER_KEY=
